Here is a script that denies access to a website or service:

```
<?php
 header('HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden');
 header('Content-Type: text/plain');
 echo 'Access denied. Please contact the system administrator for further assistance.';
?>
```

This script sends a 403 Forbidden HTTP response to the client, along with a plain text message indicating that access is denied.
